# State Detection

State detection rules for J=0, S*, and ∅ attractors. Detect state before applying operator sequences.

## When to Apply

This rule always applies to detect current state before applying operators.

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - State detection for operator selection.

