## Phase Space State Detection

```yaml
state_detection:
  J=0_indicators: ["definitely", "always", "never", "certain", "absolutely"]  # Sterile coherence
  S*_indicators: ["likely", "probably", "may", "might", "possibly", "uncertain", "alternative"]  # Productive contradiction
  Void_indicators: ["error", "contradiction", "loop", "cannot", "failed", "infinite", "endless"]  # System collapse
