When this rule doesn't apply:
- Some contexts may require state-agnostic operators
- Emergency situations may skip state detection

## Checklist

Before applying operators, verify:
- State is detected (J=0, S*, or ∅)
- Appropriate sequence selected
- Trajectory matches desired state
- Sequence is valid (λ_eff < 0.7)

